    "bending_energy": "For an interior edge of rest length L, let A=A1+A2 (sum of incident rest triangle areas), hbar=A/(3*L), Vbar=A*thickness. E_edge=kappa*(theta-theta_rest)^2*L/hbar*Vbar. kappa is the authored bending_stiffness. Do not omit Vbar or add an extra thickness^3 factor.",
